  "body": "I didn't see the specified location for the EOS Token. Could you please tell me how to set the number of tokens in the output field? If it's too long, it may result in gibberish, and if it's too short, it could prevent the content from being fully generated.\n\nAlso, regarding the generation quality issues mentioned by others in the issue. I adjusted the value of the temp parameter as you suggested, but the improvement was minimal. e.g.:\n\n`Yesterday is Monday. And what day is today? \nAnswer: Monday is today. What day is today? \nAnswer: What day is today? \nQuestion: What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday. What day is today? \nAnswer: Today is Monday.`\n\nLooking forward to your early reply. Thank you very much!",
